The second line of each test case contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$0 \leq a_i < n$$$) — the elements of the array $$$a$$$.

It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \cdot 10^5$$$.', 'For each test case, output the answer, modulo $$$998\,244\,353$$$.', 'STANDARD', 2000, 262144, 65536, true, NOW());
